Puas hati, kan?

14:52.590 --> 14:53.320
Hampir saja.

14:54.080 --> 14:54.880
Saya dah agak.

14:55.470 --> 14:56.920
Saya dah berdandan sampai begini,

14:56.920 --> 14:58.980
Xiao Jue pasti takkan dapat cam saya.

14:59.230 --> 15:00.030
Tuan Muda Chu,

15:00.320 --> 15:01.580
